    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Cultist hierophants are leaders who rule over the lives of their subordinates, set down the laws of the cult, and interpret the will of its patron. Their supernatural powers come from that patron, from other supernatural sources, or from the strength of their own fanaticism. They know the cult’s darkest secrets and often command strange relics, mystical places, and monstrous servants.</p>",
